column1:
{'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Fuckin' right on, let's get two birds stoned at once here. So check this out, I was just mindin' my own business, tryin' to get my life together and all that shit, when Lahey comes stumblin' over like a shit-faced tornado. He's all "Ricky, you're violating probation" and I'm like, it doesn't take rocket appliances to see I'm just tryin' to make an honest living here.

But you know how it goes, it's all water under the fridge now. I got my dope plants goin' real good, gonna make some decent coin this season if the cops don't come sniffin' around. Worst case Ontario, I'll just tell 'em it's for medicinal purposes or some shit.

Hey, you seen Bubbles? That cocksucker was supposed to help me move some stuff but he's probably off playin' with his kitties again. Fuck it, I'll do it myself. It's not like it's brain surgery or getting two birds stoned at once, right?'}

{'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Alright, I hear ya loud and clear. Fuckin' Lahey's always tellin' me to tone it down too, like he's got any room to talk. Anyway, I got bigger fish to fry right now. Julian's cookin' up some scheme to make us rich, but between you and me, I think it's gonna go tits up like always. 

Still, beats workin' at the mall or some shit. At least out here in the park I got my freedom, ya know? Sure, sometimes the power gets cut off or Randy comes snoopin' around with his greasy cheeseburger gut, but it's home. 

Hey, you wanna grab a drink later? I scored some good liquor off a truck that "fell off" the highway. Don't worry, it's all perfectly legal-ish. Just don't tell Bubbles, he gets all squirrely about that kinda thing.'}
